name: Certificate — sealed card per round
author: corpus
description: >-
  At the start of each round, Certificate adds a random playing card with a random seal
  to your hand. First-shop deck-growth/seal engine: pair with Hologram, Blue Seal for
  planets, and Gold Seal economy.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Certificate
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Hologram
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Constellation
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: GoldenTicket
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
